WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.285
At night Rabbit usually slept in the playroom.

2
00:00:08.286 --> 00:00:12.487
But one night Henry left Rabbit in his room.

3
00:00:12.488 --> 00:00:16.629
Henry tossed and turned in bed.

4
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:29.011
He coughed loudly.

5
00:00:29.012 --> 00:00:32.534
Mom came in and felt Henry's forehead.

6
00:00:32.535 --> 00:00:43.758
"You have a fever," she said.

7
00:00:43.759 --> 00:00:47.941
She gave Henry medicine and stroked his back.

8
00:00:47.942 --> 00:00:51.816
"You need to sleep."

9
00:00:51.817 --> 00:00:55.024
Mom saw Rabbit and brought him over.

10
00:00:55.025 --> 00:00:58.006
"Here, Henry," Mom said.

11
00:00:58.007 --> 00:01:00.933
"Rabbit will help you sleep.

12
00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:08.344
Try and rest, okay?"

13
00:01:08.345 --> 00:01:11.573
"Mmm-hmm," Henry said.

14
00:01:11.574 --> 00:01:14.067
He held Rabbit tightly.

15
00:01:14.068 --> 00:01:17.615
Rabbit felt his stuffing squish.

16
00:01:17.616 --> 00:01:21.223
Henry's body felt hot and wet.

17
00:01:21.224 --> 00:01:24.116
He coughed and coughed.

18
00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:27.544
He jerked with each cough.

19
00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:31.532
"I'm so uncomfortable!" Rabbit thought.

20
00:01:31.533 --> 00:01:34.589
But he loved Henry.

21
00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:43.091
He lay still until Henry fell asleep.

22
00:01:43.092 --> 00:01:46.903
Rabbit saw the moon shining through the window.

23
00:01:46.904 --> 00:01:50.111
Dust sparkled in the light.

24
00:01:50.112 --> 00:01:53.865
"Fairy dust!" Rabbit thought happily.

25
00:01:53.866 --> 00:01:57.949
It looked just like his dream.

26
00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:00.822
Rabbit stared at the fairy dust.

27
00:02:00.823 --> 00:02:02.826
"Maybe I'll get some.

28
00:02:02.827 --> 00:02:07.776
Maybe it will make Henry feel better!"

29
00:02:07.777 --> 00:02:10.091
Rabbit reached out his paw.

30
00:02:10.092 --> 00:02:14.153
Moonlight and dust gathered there.

31
00:02:14.154 --> 00:02:19.520
Rabbit gently rubbed his paw on Henry's arms.

32
00:02:19.521 --> 00:02:23.803
He rubbed Henry's forehead too.

33
00:02:23.804 --> 00:02:28.147
Rabbit stayed up all night long, watching Henry.

34
00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:31.494
"Will the magic dust work?" he thought.

35
00:02:31.495 --> 00:02:38.534
"Will it make Henry better?"

